AI Market Trend & Consumer Sentiment Forecaster
🚀 Project Overview

The AI Market Trend & Consumer Sentiment Forecaster is an intelligent analytics system that combines machine learning, natural language processing (NLP), and data engineering to analyze market trends and consumer sentiment in an integrated manner.

By processing both structured market data (historical trends, product metrics) and unstructured text data (customer reviews, news, and social media discussions), the system provides meaningful insights into how consumer perception influences market behavior.

This project is particularly useful for:

📌 Market analysts

📌 Business researchers

📌 Data scientists

📌 AI/ML developers

📌 Product strategists

🧠 Key Capabilities

✔ Market trend forecasting using historical data
✔ Consumer sentiment analysis using NLP models
✔ Fusion of sentiment signals with market indicators
✔ Automatic detection of sentiment spikes and anomalies
✔ Modular, scalable, and extensible Python architecture
✔ Interactive visualization dashboard for real-time insights

🔄 End-to-End Workflow
🧹 Step 1 — Data Cleaning (cleaning.py)

Removed missing values, duplicates, and inconsistencies

Standardized data formats

Improved dataset reliability for modeling

🔗 Step 2 — Data Integration

Merged product and review datasets from Amazon and Flipkart

Created a unified cross-platform dataset

📉 Step 3 — Data Reduction

Filtered redundant and low-value records

Optimized dataset size for faster processing and better model performance

🗂️ Step 4 — Product Categorization (category.py)

Assigned products to meaningful categories

Enabled category-wise sentiment and trend analysis

😊 Step 5 — Sentiment Analysis (sentiment.py)

Applied NLP techniques to analyze customer reviews

Classified sentiments as Positive, Negative, or Neutral

Simulated time-series sentiment trends using generated timestamps

🧠 Step 6 — Topic Modeling

Identified major themes in customer discussions

Revealed key factors influencing consumer opinion

🌐 Real-Time Data Sources (API Integration)
📰 news_api.py

Fetches market-related news articles

Extracts sentiment and trend signals from media

🗣️ reddit.py

Collects public discussions from Reddit

Captures crowd sentiment and opinion trends

🔗 rapid.py

Integrates external datasets via RapidAPI

Enriches analysis with additional market indicators

📊 Interactive Dashboard (Planned / Included)

The system includes (or can be extended with):

Live sentiment trend charts

Market movement visualizations

Category-wise comparison panels

News & Reddit sentiment feeds

Spike detection alerts

